# fixedbugs, defect 2409's shape, 2026-11-10: a field whose header type is a
# typedef named `unioné` stopped `heroes build` at exit 134, *string slice
# splits a character*, in `emit/ffi_nested.hero`'s `kind_of`, which cut the
# type text at `union `'s length to ask whether it names a union. It is asked
# of the bytes now (`cli/strings.starts_with`), and the field is told the
# header's type, its width and the type that builds, at exit 1.

extern "fixedbugs-2409-a-field-of-a-type-whose-name-opens-with-union-is-told.h"
    record Holder tag holder
        kind: i32
        c: i32  #~ ffi_field_type

function main()
    h = Holder(kind: 2, c: 3)
    print(h.kind)
